  "description": "Van Dessel™ Linefinder Frame – Precision. Control. Versatility.\n\nThe Van Dessel Linefinder is built for riders who demand efficiency on the climbs and confidence on the descents. With modern geometry and a responsive suspension platform, it’s ready for whatever the trail throws your way.\n\n120mm Rear Travel (185x50)Balanced, efficient travel for aggressive trail riding.\n\nHorst Link 4-Bar SuspensionFully active under all conditions - including braking - for maximum traction and control.\n\n130mm Front Travel (compatible up to 140mm)Versatile setup for a wide range of terrain.\n\n29x2.4\" Tire ClearanceConfident grip and smooth rollover for modern trail tires.\n\nIntegrated Cable RoutingClean, quiet cockpit with easy maintenance access.\n\nAdjustable ReachCustom-fit geometry to match your style and terrain.\n\nIncluded: Frame, rear thru axle, headset, seat clampNot Included: Bottom bracket or other parts required to complete build\n\nReady to build your dream trail bike? The Linefinder frameset is the perfect foundation.",
